gomad: refresh invalidated compatibility packs in one command and drop the unselected v041 variant
compatibility-pack refresh runs the pin impact report per mapped working
directory and discovers every invalidated, unapproved, or profile-stale
request in its own module, stopping at approval: a request is current only
when its stored approval equals the review digest of the fresh evidence.
Other-platform requests are reported and left untouched. A checked-in
working-directory table, shared with qualify --all and the qualification
target, maps every request to its module. modernc-libc-xsys-v041 was
selected only by its own fixture, so its pack, request, report, fixture,
and qualification entry are removed with the selection audit retained.

